{{!
  Thin Spring MVC controller implementing the interface generated from the contract (openapi-generator spring,
  interfaceOnly, useResponseEntity=false: methods return the DTO); the @RequestMapping and parameter annotations
  come from that interface, so do not repeat them here.
  Never hand-write the Api interface or DTO; they are generated from the contract.
  The caller's organisation comes from CurrentOrganisation (shared-adapter) and goes to the use case.
  Authorization (@PreAuthorize, ownership checks) is hand-written: it is a STOP item.
  Target: <capability>-adapter/src/main/java/<package path>/adapter/controller/<Name>Controller.java
  Package: "package" is the base package, without the ".adapter.controller" this template appends (com.example.guest
          renders package com.example.guest.adapter.controller); <package path> is that base as a path.
          scripts/scaffold.sh refuses a target outside the directory of the package the file declares.
  Vars:   package, basePackage (root holding common/), Name, Api (generated interface),
          apiPackage (package of the generated interface), modelPackage (package of the generated DTOs),
          UseCase, useCase (camelCase), operationId (generated method), Domain (use-case result type)
}}
